gl-stereo (0.2.0-1) testing; urgency=medium

  * Package the stereo layer, launcher, qualified savers and Plasma show.
  * Use libstereo-declare 1.1.0 for the single full side-by-side declaration.
  * Respect compositor-owned X11 sizing from support version 3.
  * Preserve visual buffer attributes with Mesa's stereo visual twins.
